<ansi fg="black-bold">.:</ansi> <ansi fg="magenta">Help for </ansi><ansi fg="yellow">Large</ansi> mutation

Your frame expands beyond normal proportions. Bones thicken, muscles
swell. You become a towering presence — harder to miss, but far
harder to fell.

<ansi fg="yellow">Type:</ansi>     Passive
<ansi fg="yellow">Rarity:</ansi>   Very Rare

<ansi fg="yellow">Benefits:</ansi>
  Moderately increased maximum health — your massive frame absorbs
  punishment that would cripple a smaller person
  Moderately increased combat damage from sheer size and mass

<ansi fg="yellow">Drawbacks:</ansi>
  Reduced dodge chance — your imposing bulk is an easy target
  Moderately reduced dexterity — size and nimbleness rarely coexist

<ansi fg="yellow">Conflicts:</ansi> Small

<ansi fg="magenta-bold">See also:</ansi> <ansi fg="command">help mutations</ansi>
